# Translation of Odoo Server.
# This file contains the translation of the following modules:
# 	* partner_microsite_manager
#
# Scope is the footer only, on purpose.
#
# The footer of every microsite and every zone is this module's own template,
# which has no website_id, so website_auto_translate leaves it alone -- and
# rightly so: translating an addon's view in the database would fight the
# module on every update. Its wording belongs here instead.
#
# The legal pages are deliberately NOT translated. A privacy policy or a set of
# terms and conditions run through a machine translator is a liability, not a
# service, and Spanish is the language they were written and reviewed in.
#
# There is no en.po for this module, and that is also deliberate. Odoo keeps
# en_US as the technical base of a translatable column, and this module's views
# hold their Spanish there with no es_ES entry of their own. An en.po would
# overwrite that base, which is precisely how 2134 records lost their Spanish
# on 2026-08-14. An English visitor reads the Spanish footer until the base is
# protected; that is a blemish, not a loss.
#
